      "title": "A Cafe Where Cats Live",
      "text": "In many cities around the world, cat cafes have become very popular. These are places where people can enjoy a cup of coffee and (1)______ time with friendly cats. The idea started in Asia, but now you can find these cafes in Europe and North America too. Most of the cats in these cafes (2)______ from local animal shelters. The owners of the cafes hope that visitors will fall in love with the animals and decide to (3)______ them. It is a great way to help cats find a new home. Before you enter, there are usually some rules to follow. For example, you should not wake up a cat that is sleeping. Visitors are (4)______ to be gentle and quiet so that the cats feel safe. Many people find that visiting a cat cafe is a very (5)______ experience. It is the perfect place to relax after a busy day. If you are looking for a unique way to spend an afternoon, a cat cafe is (6)______ a visit.",
